6393090_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SMUZZTi2QGYQ7kNvwH-fBti&_nc_oc=AdmPdC7fraIzHNmxZKSwWF6jBH3ZTIILpVfdgmoBJ1pE6SxX-Ym7OzOYNhI4D2rDefQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzwtBzo_qLNxqmaT0ix7dRLIlBoD5Eu_ajuFIy1IGY8dQ&oe=69B2B8F6"}, {"file_name": "magiclab.png", "id": "571678028809339", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_571678032142672_4802457235566616749_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZsxnFx7hj9AQ7kNvwEpvdth&_nc_oc=AdnAvxG74kGo6FT3Me2EnS0oQbLzj1drbWnupvSih-IuGTrPMbyJr93S9GkPrsZr2vY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfznPudKg4-zCkrf0dJCc4IiGjSwcFf_CtxOTZB2LDiwxA&oe=69B2C273"}, {"file_name": "Store Images-6.png", "id": "1345003753277335", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307555_1345003756610668_1826594110833715176_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mMiQQld5gMAQ7kNvwHagMT7&_nc_oc=AdmlZsWEKJQ3b7_QPyvBmbzYIMtI4cDTuuP9U4fCmUCjoAJgyyqssd_ph1M_ohcBsKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyAWTpagDc5FjeFdZDEOCbLGJZ_o2SC7EQ_50lZs709Tg&oe=69B2CD7E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Simulator", "keywords": ["magic", "wand", "duel", "wizard", "rpg"], "long_description": "# Master Magic Spells\nHarness the power of your wand to cast incredible spells with precision. Summon fire, control the elements, and unlock new magical abilities as you explore a mystical world.\n\n# Brew Powerful Potions\nDive into the art of potion-making! Combine rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and create potions that heal, enhance, or devastate in the heat of battle.\n\n# Duel Other Players\nOutsmart your opponents with quick reflexes and strategic spellcasting in intense multiplayer battles.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate wizard?\n\n{1411794410259308}", "short_description": "Cast magic spells, brew powerful potions, and duel other players in epi